            "review_title": "Review at BENA.Seafood",
            "review_text": "Scott Y\nVancouver, Canada4 contributions\n1\nOne of the highlights in Da Nang\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nDa Nang have hundreds of sea food restaurants available, we took a gamble and decided to try this place, and We were so glad we did. \nOur food was scooped out of the tank and cooked right in front of us. \nThe BBQ razor clams/ steam clams are both amazing.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 4, 2019\nBENA_SEAFOOD\nThanks for coming and being our guests . Your evaluations and rank have inspired and motivated our job . Thank you so much .\nWritten March 5, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
