            "review_title": "Review at BENA.Seafood",
            "review_text": "Jungbae\n1 contribution\n0\nCheating price\nFeb 2019 • Family\nHi, I had visited Be na live sea food restaurant in 2019 Feb. The cost I payed is 30 times more than other local restaurants. I think the atmosphere is good but taste is so so. I waited for a long time (~1h) to have a dinner with my family in this restaurant then we enjoyed dinner. When we try to pay dinner, price is dramatically increased and the owner could not speak English. I would like to inform that people are aware of that situation in that restaurant.\n안녕하세요, 저는 2 월 2019 년에 바다 음식을 먹을 수있는 음식점을 방문했습니다. 제가 지불 한 비용은 다른 지역 음식점보다 30 배나 많습니다. 분위기는 좋지만 맛은 너무 좋아요. 나는이 레스토랑에서 가족과 저녁 식사를하기 위해 오랜 시간 (~ 1 시간) 기다렸다가 저녁 식사를 즐겼다. 우리가 저녁을 먹으려 고 할 때, 가격이 급격히 증가하고 주인은 영어를 할 수 없습니다. 나는 사람들이 그 식당의 상황을 알고 있음을 알려 드리고자합니다.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 22, 2019\nBENA_SEAFOOD\nHello Jungbae5878!\n\nI am Phu, the owner of the restaurant. Can you tell me the date, time you came to use our service, the position of the table you sat in and the amount you have to pay for dinner? I will take a photo of the bill for your dinner that day to confirm we are not cheating the price. Prices are clearly displayed on the menu according to each dish and managed by the restaurant's management system. Sorry for the long wait for you and your family, the food takes time to be meticulously processed. At our location, the price of the clearly stated and quality food is well appreciated by the crowd, all your complaints will be resolved publicly. Maybe you mistaken service staff and me because I can use the English language. We have put in a lot of effort to achieve high rankings from our customers' trust as well as our local food and service quality. So your objective assessment has a direct impact on our business, I hope to receive feedback from you.\n\nThanks You & Best Regards\nRead more\nWritten February 28, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
