            "review_text": "Luke L\nParis, France11 contributions\n0\nNot a Gordon Ramsey restaurant\nNov 2018 • Solo\nNot sure if I’m still in Vietnam. After reading many reviews and blog posts recommending this place. I decided to spoil myself and took a grab to come here for seafood. Unlike many reviews suggested, this place is beyond pricy. 1.35m vnd per kg of live crab. 400k for 10 bbq shrimp which you can easily find anywhere else below 100k.\n\nIf you are far away, don’t bother to come check it out. It’s not worth it unless you feel comfortable with the price\nRead more\nWritten November 16, 2018",
