            "review_text": "Traveler429831\n5 contributions\n0\nFresh seafood restaurant in DaNang\nJun 2018\nLast month, I and my friends accidentally found this restaurant while going around Danang. We’re first impressed by its lovely garden. The owner’s very nice, showing us many kinds of seafood with resonnable prices. All the didhes we tried were great, fresh and hygienic. What a wonderful restaurant in a wonderful coastal city! We’ll definitely come back.Highly recommendation!!\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2018\nBENA_SEAFOOD\nThanks you for your visit and leave a review for us , your contribution helps us to better our service . Thanks You and Best Regards <3\nWritten June 24, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
