            "review_text": "Tweets\nRichmond Hill, Ontario, Canada11 contributions\n0\nSeafood Fresh Catch\nMar 2018 • Family\nHad a great experience here after reading many Google reviews. Taxi drivers tried to get us to go to other seafood restaurants but we wanted to try this one. Glad we did. Cute garden, nice atmosphere, clean tables, owners clean the seafood and throw away dead clams. Flavour is good as we are picky viets. Taxis tried to get us to eat at other restaurants. This one is family run, they are honest people and won't rip off foreigners.\nRead more\nWritten March 8, 2018\nBENA_SEAFOOD\nThanks you for your visit and leave a review for us , your contribution helps us to better our service . Thanks You and Best Regards <3 Hope to see you again <3\nPhu ^^ Na\nRead more\nWritten March 9, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
