            "review_title": "Review at BENA.Seafood",
            "review_text": "Koko063\nParis, France36 contributions\n0\nWonderful Last Supper in Danang\nJan 2018\nBe Na is for us the best seafood restaurant in Danang. Like the very popular and bustling Be Man, it has very fresh seafood. Unlike Be Man, the service is very personalized and the atmosphere relaxed which makes the whole dining experience something to savor. The restaurant is a little out of the city center hence very quiet. When we arrived in the cab, the owner Phu came up and opened the door for us. We were shown the catches of the day which were crab, several types of fish, clams and oysters. As the restaurant did not accept credit card and we had only about 1 million dong (50$) to spend, Phu worked with us to come up with a menu we could afford. So for a little less than 50$, we had a big bowl of heavenly steamed clams, a delicious chili crab, and a lovely grilled fish accompanied with salad and rice paper (so we can make wraps out of the fish), 3 Huda beer and two wonderful slow-dripping Vietnamese coffee. Phu and his wife Na were friendly, attentive but not intrusive. Sitting in the garden, leisurely watching the fat cat sleeping and enjoying the great fresh seafood, un-harried by noise and crowd, it was a wonderful way to end our trip in Danang.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2018\nBENA_SEAFOOD\nThanks you for your visit and leave a review for us , your contribution helps us to better our service . Thanks You and Best Regards <3 Hope to see you again <3\nPhu ^^ Na\nRead more\nWritten January 20, 2018\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
